; Class-2 EMERGENT recoverability: idle iff data==target, expressed via TWO inequalities
; (no eq node), so the syntactic eq_guard_atoms extractor finds nothing. data,target 48-bit,
; both init 0, both increment by 1 => data==target INVARIANT. AG EF idle HOLDS, provable only
; with the emergent relation data==target (else wide adds UF-wrap => busy may-loops => bottom).
1 sort bitvec 1
2 sort bitvec 48
3 state 1 ctrl
4 state 2 data
5 state 2 target
6 zero 2
7 one 2
9 one 1
